# Supabase Edge Function secrets
# Set via: supabase secrets set KEY=value --project-ref <ref>
# List current secrets: supabase secrets list --project-ref <ref>
# These are available to ALL edge functions in the project.

# ── Supabase (auto-injected for most, but explicit for admin ops) ───────
# SUPABASE_URL             — Project API URL. Auto-injected by Supabase runtime.
# SUPABASE_ANON_KEY        — Anon/public key. Auto-injected by Supabase runtime.
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY — Service-role key for admin operations. Auto-injected by Supabase runtime.
# SUPABASE_DB_URL          — Direct Postgres connection string. Set in Supabase secrets.

# ── Email (Resend) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# RESEND_API_KEY           — Resend API key for transactional email. Set in Supabase secrets.
# SEND_EMAIL_HOOK_SECRET   — Webhook HMAC secret for Supabase auth Send Email hook. Set in Supabase secrets and auth hook config.

# ── Push notifications ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ONESIGNAL_APP_ID         — OneSignal application ID. Set in Supabase secrets.
# ONESIGNAL_REST_API_KEY   — OneSignal REST API key. Set in Supabase secrets.
# VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY         — Web Push VAPID public key. Set in Supabase secrets + VITE_VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY in Vercel.
# VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY        — Web Push VAPID private key. Set in Supabase secrets.
# VAPID_SUBJECT            — Web Push VAPID subject (mailto: or https: URL). Set in Supabase secrets.

# ── Payments (Stripe) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# STRIPE_SECRET_KEY        — Stripe secret key. Set in Supabase secrets.
# STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET    — Stripe webhook signing secret. Set in Supabase secrets.
# STRIPE_CONNECT_WEBHOOK_SECRET — Stripe Connect webhook signing secret. Set in Supabase secrets.

# ── Scheduler / cron ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# CRON_SECRET              — Shared secret for poll-scheduler cron invocations. Set in Supabase secrets.
# POLL_CRON_SECRET         — Shared secret for poll-based cron jobs. Set in Supabase secrets.
# EDGE_SERVICE_KEY         — Service key for edge-to-edge function calls. Set in Supabase secrets.

# ── Third-party integrations ───────────────────────────────────────────
# PLAYTOMIC_CLIENT_ID      — Playtomic API client ID. Set in Supabase secrets.
# PLAYTOMIC_SECRET         — Playtomic API secret. Set in Supabase secrets.
